WEBVTT

00:37:57.847 --> 00:38:00.642
I'm such a perfectionist,
and I'm such a Goody Two-shoes,

00:38:00.666 --> 00:38:02.790
and I try so hard to never
do anything wrong,

00:38:02.814 --> 00:38:05.781
so when I see people behaving
in a way that I would call wrong,

00:38:05.805 --> 00:38:07.298
I can be very condemning of it.

00:38:07.322 --> 00:38:09.800
And what I loved about Rayya
more than anything else

00:38:09.824 --> 00:38:13.087
was that she understood that
there are people trapped in their minds

00:38:13.111 --> 00:38:15.607
in ways that somebody like me
could never understand,

00:38:15.631 --> 00:38:19.075
and she could be in the room
with absolutely anybody

00:38:19.099 --> 00:38:21.099
who was behaving in absolutely any way.

00:38:21.123 --> 00:38:22.761
And she had tremendous boundaries.

00:38:22.785 --> 00:38:26.482
She would never let them mess with her.
She was very street-smart, very tough.

00:38:26.506 --> 00:38:30.654
But she also was the most
forgiving human being I've ever met.